# This directory is a deny-all list with a small set of allowed fixture file
# types, so a new fixture is tracked without touching this file (see #561).
# Anything not matched by an allow rule below (build output, editor droppings,
# compiled binaries, caches) stays ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!*.html
!*.txt
!*.css
!*.json
!*.py

# Local manual test artifact, not a fixture.
test.txt
